    privacyP1: 'We value user privacy protection. For the specific privacy policy, please refer to "I Ching Insight Privacy Protection Policy".',
    privacyP2: 'The collection, use and storage of user personal information will follow the principles of legality, propriety and necessity.',
    disclaimer: '8. Disclaimer',
    disclaimerP1: 'I Ching Insight services generate content based on algorithms and AI models, which may be inaccurate or incomplete. Users should make their own judgment and bear corresponding risks.',
    disclaimerP2: 'We are not liable for service interruption or data loss caused by force majeure (including but not limited to natural disasters, wars, policy changes, network failures, etc.).',
    disclaimerP3: 'We shall not be liable for any direct or indirect losses incurred by users due to the use of the services.',
    paidService: '9. Paid Services',
    paidP1: 'I Ching Insight provides some paid services (such as VIP membership). The specific prices and service content are subject to the page display.',
    paidP2: 'Once paid services are purchased, refunds are not provided unless otherwise stipulated by laws and regulations.',
    paidP3: 'We have the right to adjust the prices and content of paid services, and will notify users through appropriate methods before the adjustment.',
    dataDelete: '10. Data Deletion',
    dataDeleteP: 'You can apply to delete all data at any time. After the deletion application is confirmed twice, the data will be immediately and completely deleted and cannot be restored. Please think carefully before confirming.',
    termination: '11. Termination of Agreement',
    terminationP1: 'Users have the right to stop using the services at any time and can apply for account cancellation.',
    terminationP2: 'If users violate this Agreement, we have the right to immediately terminate the services without prior notice.',
    terminationP3: 'After the agreement is terminated, user data will be handled in accordance with the privacy policy.',
    lawApply: '12. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution',
    lawApplyP1: 'The conclusion, validity, performance, interpretation and dispute resolution of this Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the People\'s Republic of China.',
    lawApplyP2: 'Any dispute arising from this Agreement shall be resolved through friendly consultation by both parties; if consultation fails, either party may file a lawsuit with the People\'s Court having jurisdiction at the location of Beijing Wuyuan Digital Technology Co., Ltd.',
    contact: '13. Contact Us',
    contactOp: 'Operating Entity: Beijing Wuyuan Digital Technology Co., Ltd.',
    contactEmail: 'Contact Email: ccbaby2813@139.com',
    contactIcp: 'Website Filing: Beijing ICP Filing No. 16050769-4',
    privacyIntro: 'Introduction',
    privacyIntroP1: 'Beijing Wuyuan Digital Technology Co., Ltd. (hereinafter "we") deeply understands the importance of personal information to you. We will take corresponding security protection measures in accordance with legal requirements to protect your personal information safely and controllably.',
    privacyIntroP2: 'This policy applies to all services provided by I Ching Insight, including WeChat Mini Program, web version, Android/iOS applications.',
    privacyCollect: '1. Information We Collect',
    privacyCollectP1: 'Account Information: When you register a I Ching Insight account, we will collect your WeChat openid or phone number to create and identify your account.',
    privacyCollectP2: 'Personal Information: When you create a profile, we will collect your basic information such as nickname, gender, and date of birth to generate I Ching personality interpretations.',
    privacyCollectP3: 'Usage Data: We will automatically collect device information, operation logs, insight records, etc. when you use the services to optimize your service experience.',
    privacyCollectP4: 'Location Information: We will not actively collect your location information unless you explicitly authorize it.',
    privacyUse: '2. Use of Information',
    privacyUseP1: 'The information we collect will be used for the following purposes:',
    privacyUseItem1: '· Providing core services such as I Ching personality interpretation, deep insight, and soul matching',
    privacyUseItem2: '· Optimizing product features and user experience',
    privacyUseItem3: '· Sending service notifications (such as matching results, letter replies, etc.)',
    privacyUseItem4: '· Conducting data analysis and research to improve service quality',
    privacyUseItem5: '· Complying with legal requirements',
    privacyUseP2: 'We will not use your personal information for other purposes without your consent.',
    privacyStore: '3. Storage of Information',
    privacyStoreP1: 'Your personal information will be stored on servers within China.',
    privacyStoreP2: 'We adopt industry-standard security measures to protect your information, including but not limited to encrypted transmission, access control, and regular backups.',
    privacyStoreP3: 'We will retain your personal information only for the time necessary to achieve the purpose. After the retention period, it will be deleted or anonymized.',
    privacyShare: '4. Sharing and Disclosure of Information',
    privacyShareP1: 'We will not share your personal information with third parties unless:',
    privacyShareItem1: '· Obtaining your explicit consent',
    privacyShareItem2: '· According to legal requirements or government agency requirements',
    privacyShareItem3: '· Sharing with our affiliates (limited to what is necessary to provide services)',
    privacyShareItem4: '· Involved in merger, acquisition or asset transfer',
    privacyShareP2: 'In the soul matching feature, we will display necessary information such as your nickname and hexagram to the matching object, but will not disclose your true identity.',
    privacyRight: '5. Your Rights',
    privacyRightP1: 'Access and Correction: You can access and correct your personal information at any time.',
    privacyRightP2: 'Deletion: You can apply to delete your personal information, except where retention is required by laws and regulations.',
    privacyRightP3: 'Account Cancellation: You can apply to cancel your account. After cancellation, we will delete your personal information.',
    privacyRightP4: 'Withdrawal of Consent: You can withdraw your consent to our collection and use of your personal information, but this may affect the use of some services.',
    privacyMinor: '6. Protection of Minors',
    privacyMinorP1: 'We attach great importance to the protection of personal information of minors.',
    privacyMinorP2: 'If you are a minor, please read this policy accompanied by your guardian and use our services with your guardian\'s consent.',
    privacyMinorP3: 'This product is only for users aged 18 and above. The date picker restricts selecting birth dates for users under 18.',
    privacyCookie: '7. Cookies and Similar Technologies',
    privacyCookieP1: 'We may use cookies or similar technologies to collect and use your information to provide a better service experience.',
    privacyCookieP2: 'You can manage or delete cookies through browser settings, but this may affect the use of some features.',
    privacySdk: '8. Ads & Third-party SDKs',
    privacySdkP1: 'To provide stable and secure services, our Android/iOS apps integrate the WeChat multi-platform development framework SDK (Donut) and the Mobile Security Alliance (MSA) advertising identifier SDK.',
    privacySdkP2: 'These SDKs may obtain device information such as your anonymous advertising identifier (OAID/Advertising ID), device model, OS version, and network status, for advertising attribution, anti-fraud, and service operation optimization. We do not use advertising identifiers to identify your personal identity.',
    privacySdkP3: "You can enable 'Limit Ad Tracking' in your system settings. The service will still function normally after enabling it; it only affects ad-related recommendation features.",
    privacyUpdate: '9. Updates to Privacy Policy',
    privacyUpdateP1: 'We may revise this policy from time to time, and the revised content will be published on the I Ching Insight platform.',
    privacyUpdateP2: 'If the revision involves significant changes, we will notify you in a prominent way.',
    privacyContact: '10. Contact Us',
